{
  "name": "cotutor",
  "version": "0.4.3",
  "releaseNotes": [
    "自动备份:服务开着时每天一份,升级前一份,可以恢复;录音占地方,不在备份里",
    "家长端首页多了「还差几步」,第一次打开就知道接下来做什么;选一下年级老师就知道孩子上几年级",
    "遇到问题时,家长端「设置」能生成诊断信息,不含孩子的对话和 key,先看再发",
    "`cotutor init --grade` 自动算好学期,`cotutor doctor --fix` 一次修掉能自动修的"
  ],
  "description": "AI tutors that co-teach with parents at home: real-time voice, an interactive whiteboard, and learning memory in your own Obsidian vault. Self-hosted; built for China's elementary curriculum.",
  "type": "module",
  "license": "SEE LICENSE IN LICENSE",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/TarsLab/cotutor.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/TarsLab/cotutor#readme",
  "bugs": "https://github.com/TarsLab/cotutor/issues",
  "keywords": [
    "ai",
    "agent",
    "qwen-code",
    "tutor",
    "education",
    "elementary",
    "realtime",
    "voice",
    "obsidian",
    "cli"
  ],
  "bin": {
    "cotutor": "bin/cotutor.js"
  },
  "sideEffects": [
    "*.css"
  ],
  "exports": {
    "./schema": {
      "types": "./dist/schema/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./dist/schema/index.js"
    },
    "./workspace": {
      "types": "./dist/app/workspace.d.ts",
      "default": "./dist/app/workspace.js"
    },
    "./lib": {
      "types": "./dist/lib/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./dist/lib/index.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "bin",
    "dist",
    "grades",
    "themes",
    "avatars",
    "cards",
    "skills",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "NOTICE"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "gen:skills": "node --experimental-strip-types scripts/gen-skills.ts",
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit",
    "test": "node --experimental-strip-types scripts/test.ts",
    "build": "rm -rf dist && tsc -p tsconfig.build.json",
    "prepublishOnly": "pnpm run typecheck && pnpm run test && pnpm run build && pnpm run build:stage && pnpm run smoke",
    "smoke": "node --experimental-strip-types scripts/smoke.ts",
    "build:stage": "node scripts/build-stage.mjs"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.18"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@ai-sdk/alibaba": "2.0.78",
    "@excalidraw/excalidraw": "0.18.1",
    "ai": "7.0.155",
    "hanzi-writer-data": "2.0.1",
    "react": "^18.3.1",
    "react-dom": "^18.3.1",
    "typescript": "^5.6.0",
    "zod": "^4.4.3"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^22.20.1",
    "@types/react": "^18.3.31",
    "@types/react-dom": "^18.3.7",
    "esbuild": "^0.28.2"
  }
}
